# Scope and Definition of Done

Implement only what was asked. No speculative features, extra knobs, or drive-by refactors. If something else turns up, leave it for a follow-up.

Done means:

- Tests first, then `uv run pytest` green. No `time.sleep` or `asyncio.sleep` in tests.
- `uv run mypy ytmusic_tui/ tests/` clean
- `uv run ruff check ytmusic_tui/ tests/` and `uv run ruff format --check ytmusic_tui/ tests/` clean
- Conventional Commits (`feat:`, `fix:`, `refactor:`, `test:`, `chore:`, `docs:`)
- The diff is only the requested change
